# The root selects an occurrence through the special name data (the author 2026-11-11, R6; plan M11 5a): the root run
# over itself is its data, and data\[1]x is the second declaration of x, with the value 3.
# Plan M11 5v: the root declares no ordinary Structure; the occurrences are the places x (they were the records Model).
int: x 2
int: x 3
int: seen data\[1]x
